1. Project introduction
This project simulates the billing operations of a subscription-based technology company offering digital products.

It focuses on analyzing subscription revenue, payment failures, failed transactions, chargebacks, customer churn, and billing-related support requests.

Using SQL, Python, Excel, and Power BI, the project will build a billing analytics solution to identify revenue leakage, investigate payment failure patterns, forecast financial performance, evaluate customer behaviour, and measure the effectiveness of billing strategy changes through A/B testing.

The ultimate goal is to help a subscription business reduce payment failures, minimize financial risks, improve customer retention, and optimize billing performance through data-driven decisions.
